Oh, come on, lift!

265
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,837
Where did they hide you?!

266
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:43,897
Uso...

267
00:14:43,980 --> 00:14:45,380
Lund, please.

268
00:14:46,180 --> 00:14:47,197
Uso...

269
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:48,360
Lund...

270
00:14:50,340 --> 00:14:51,170
Usuland?

271
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:53,960
Who's Usuland?

272
00:14:54,940 --> 00:14:57,293
They said that name before, didn't they?

273
00:14:58,040 --> 00:15:06,330
Usuland!

274
00:15:09,620 --> 00:15:10,960
