278
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:20,200
Who the heck is Usuland?

279
00:15:20,380 --> 00:15:21,280
Oh, come on.

280
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:23,814
It's a friend of the Tontada, remember?

281
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:25,880
