284
00:15:35,640 --> 00:15:37,380
Usuland is our hero!

285
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:40,900
Oh, you're a hero.

286
00:15:41,620 --> 00:15:45,380
So, he's gonna come and
rescue you any second now.

287
00:15:45,540 --> 00:15:46,400
He sure will.

288
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:49,160
