289
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:50,960
But that's all right.

290
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:52,700
He'll fix everything.

291
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:54,580
He'll save this kingdom.

292
00:15:55,520 --> 00:16:00,640
He'll rescue the toys who were forced to
slave away day after day at this port.

293
00:16:01,760 --> 00:16:03,117
He's talking about us.

294
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:07,817
And he'll reunite us with our friends
who are held captive at the factory.

295
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:12,157
He'll restore all the toys we're
forced to put on a happy face.

296
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:16,637
He'll dry the tears and vanquish the
darkness they have buried in their hearts.

297
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:20,037
And the poor big people
who don't even know what

298
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:23,217
they've lost Will be reunited
with their loved ones.

299
00:16:23,300 --> 00:16:24,817
And he'll save us too.

300
