That's why I'm not afraid!

301
00:16:27,060 --> 00:16:30,380
Cause we have a real hero on our side.

302
00:16:35,740 --> 00:16:37,720
I don't need to be a hero!

303
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:39,060
No, thank you!

304
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:42,420
I almost feel sorry for you guys.

305
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:45,340
Your big hero lied to you. What?

306
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:46,830
Too bad.

307
00:16:47,260 --> 00:16:49,436
Looks like you saps got fooled again.

308
00:16:49,540 --> 00:16:50,780
You really think so?

309
00:16:51,020 --> 00:16:55,577
Even though you're all beat up, this
Usulang guy still isn't coming to save you.

310
00:16:55,660 --> 00:16:57,337
That says it all, doesn't it?

311
00:16:57,420 --> 00:17:00,244
You think a real hero
would leave you like this?

312
00:17:00,380 --> 00:17:01,657
Huh, do you?

313
00:17:01,740 --> 00:17:06,357
But he told us he'd help
us if things got bad,

314
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:08,637
but he's not helping—I bet he's awesome!

315
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:10,117
We're laughing at you right now.

316
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:16,337
I bet there's some coward
out there who told you he'd

317
00:17:16,420 --> 00:17:19,277
make everything right
somehow—whoever the heck he is,

318
00:17:19,360 --> 00:17:22,697
but I also bet he'd shake it
out as soon as things look bad,

319
00:17:22,780 --> 00:17:25,157
so you might as well give up hope.

320
00:17:25,240 --> 00:17:28,117
Sorry, but he's right if you
want some advice—do like.

321
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:31,340
advice do like Goosalantin,
get the hell out of here!

322
00:17:31,520 --> 00:17:32,800
It can't be!

323
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:39,780
Shut up!

324
00:17:40,780 --> 00:17:42,300
He'll show you!

325
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:46,540
