329
00:18:11,180 --> 00:18:14,840
So when he tells us he'll save
the day, then we believe him.

330
00:18:14,980 --> 00:18:18,040
And that means you're going
to be sorry real soon.

331
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:24,440
That's right.

332
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:26,660
He'll be here! Yeah!

333
00:18:33,800 --> 00:18:39,600
A hero would never lie to us because
a hero will always keep his words.

334
00:18:41,620 --> 00:18:46,840
So you'd better stop insulting
Oozolent or you're really gonna pay.

335
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:48,800
What is it?

336
00:18:48,940 --> 00:18:51,293
If you're gonna laugh, better do it now.

337
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:55,920
Once Oozolent gets here,
then you're gonna cry.

338
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:01,340
He said Piggya.

339
00:19:01,740 --> 00:19:02,860
That's funny.

340
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:08,120
So that's what you say when
you die, huh? Piggya? Leo!

341
00:19:08,940 --> 00:19:10,477
What Leo said was true.

342
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:12,140
Usuland is on his way.

343
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:15,280
He'll carry out Operation S .O .P.

344
00:19:15,460 --> 00:19:17,640
and he'll save all the Tantana.

345
00:19:18,360 --> 00:19:19,190
Piggya!

346
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:22,940
Go ahead.

347
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:25,800
Be as cruel as you like.

348
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:27,410
Piggya!

349
00:19:29,220 --> 00:19:31,340
Let's go ahead and go!

350
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:34,100
Let's see this hero of yours!

351
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:36,180
Oh man, that's not pretty bad!

352
00:19:38,820 --> 00:19:40,220
Stop it!

353
00:19:40,640 --> 00:19:41,800
Stop it!

354
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:46,460
Enough already! I'm here!

355
00:19:52,860 --> 00:19:54,460
It's Usalad!

356
00:19:54,700 --> 00:19:56,300
Usalad is here!

357
