369
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:34,380
He's from the Straw Hats?

370
00:20:34,600 --> 00:20:36,071
What are they doing here?

371
00:20:44,420 --> 00:20:45,560
You're wrong!

372
00:20:46,460 --> 00:20:49,160
Why would you say something like that?

373
00:20:52,760 --> 00:20:58,700
Even if you're a pirate,
you still can be a hero!

374
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:01,220
A pirate's a pirate, okay?

375
00:21:01,580 --> 00:21:02,580
Not a hero!

376
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:08,340
I already told you I
was lying! Give it up!

377
00:21:08,580 --> 00:21:10,460
Don't make me repeat myself!

378
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:13,180
Stop having so much faith in me!

379
00:21:13,300 --> 00:21:14,200
It's pointless!

380
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:24,980
Whoa, that's funny!

381
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:28,037
You came all the way back
here just to say that,

382
00:21:28,120 --> 00:21:30,520
