383
00:21:31,440 --> 00:21:32,270
That's right!

384
00:21:32,560 --> 00:21:35,837
Otherwise, those fools would
wait around for me till they die!

385
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:39,155
If that happened, I wouldn't
be able to sleep at night.

386
00:21:40,120 --> 00:21:43,473
So I wanted to thank them for
believing in a guy like me.

387
00:21:43,940 --> 00:21:46,757
If I have to sacrifice
myself for them, that's fine.

388
00:21:46,840 --> 00:21:49,117
It's much cooler than running away!

389
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:55,157
I'm Usopp—you hear me, you better!

390
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,497
Remember my name: Totanas.

391
00:21:56,580 --> 00:22:02,337
If I die here fighting for you, you gotta
build a statue of me next to Nolan's.

392
00:22:02,420 --> 00:22:04,597
