Well, sit back and watch
because I'm about to.

394
00:22:07,440 --> 00:22:09,440
to You can't become one right now!

395
00:22:12,680 --> 00:22:14,100
Usopp, I...

396
00:22:15,160 --> 00:22:15,990
Usopp?

397
00:22:16,073 --> 00:22:17,240
From the Straw Hats?

398
00:22:17,540 --> 00:22:19,517
You think he's actually gonna save us?

399
00:22:19,600 --> 00:22:21,200
