400
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:26,840
Just give up.

401
00:22:26,940 --> 00:22:29,116
I'll take my chances, special attack!

402
00:22:29,220 --> 00:22:30,320
Green Star!

403
00:22:30,900 --> 00:22:32,740
Plant on us! Yuck!

404
00:22:35,040 --> 00:22:35,870
Yuck!

405
00:22:36,180 --> 00:22:37,020
Yuck! Xunikin!

406
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:40,070
Yuck!

407
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:47,240
Yuck! Yuck!

408
00:22:49,160 --> 00:22:52,729
Yuck!

409
00:22:52,812 --> 00:22:53,642
How do you like that?

410
00:22:53,725 --> 00:22:54,555
Now that's how a legendary hero does it!

411
00:22:54,638 --> 00:22:56,165
Let's hear it for the
Sniper of the Straw Hats!

412
00:22:56,520 --> 00:22:58,140
Captain Usopp!

413
00:22:58,680 --> 00:22:59,520
Usopp! Usopp!

414
00:22:59,740 --> 00:23:00,777
Our hero!

415
00:23:00,860 --> 00:23:02,400
No, Usa!

416
00:23:02,580 --> 00:23:04,480
Usa-land, our hero!

417
00:23:05,060 --> 00:23:06,877
Look, it's Usa, you little bastards!

418
00:23:06,960 --> 00:23:10,720
The legendary hero, Usa-land!

419
00:23:14,740 --> 00:23:17,377
There was a report that you
were on the first floor, sir.

420
00:23:17,460 --> 00:23:18,290
Huh?

421
00:23:18,373 --> 00:23:19,337
What are you talking about?

422
00:23:19,420 --> 00:23:21,437
Maybe it was someone who looks like you.

423
00:23:21,520 --> 00:23:23,160
Who the hell looks like me?

424
00:23:24,180 --> 00:23:26,360
Something's going on. King Rick.

425
00:23:29,100 --> 00:23:30,657
This is a fine sword.

426
00:23:30,740 --> 00:23:35,257
If I turn back into a human,
this will do, Straw Hat!

427
00:23:35,340 --> 00:23:37,777
My father was fighting
in the Coliseum today.

428
00:23:37,860 --> 00:23:43,877
The old king he was spurred into action
after Doflamingo lied about his abdication.

429
00:23:43,960 --> 00:23:48,737
Today I decided to fight back like him,

430
00:23:48,820 --> 00:23:52,380
King Rick was fighting in the Coliseum.

431
00:23:56,360 --> 00:23:58,237
There was a squabble in the slums.

432
00:23:58,320 --> 00:23:59,397
Two people are dead.

433
00:23:59,480 --> 00:24:01,157
