against dozens of angry thugs.

448
00:24:48,800 --> 00:24:52,212
And in the end, more than half
of them were badly injured.

449
00:24:53,260 --> 00:24:58,497
and two were killed that's true but
they ganged up on my best friend and

450
00:24:58,580 --> 00:25:01,297
murdered him i was only taking revenge

451
00:25:01,380 --> 00:25:05,997
for his death what are you a beast call me

452
00:25:06,080 --> 00:25:10,357
whatever you like you haven't lived
my life you don't know a damn thing my

453
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:16,720
friend he was like a brother to me all
right he was the only person i ever trusted

454
00:25:19,460 --> 00:25:23,780
Kiros was your name Come with me, please

455
00:25:27,300 --> 00:25:32,260
The 15-year-old murderer Kiros is facing
off with one of our seasoned veterans

456
00:25:33,140 --> 00:25:35,600
This coliseum is a sacred place

457
00:25:40,540 --> 00:25:44,893
That's true skill If his blade wasn't
blunt, he would have killed that man

458
00:25:45,300 --> 00:25:48,480
I'd call it savagery,
but here, it's skill.

459
00:25:50,080 --> 00:25:51,560
How is Kiros doing?

460
00:25:52,200 --> 00:25:55,788
He nearly killed all the convict
gladiators he was held with.

461
00:25:55,900 --> 00:25:56,730
King Rick!

462
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:59,077
