463
00:25:59,160 --> 00:26:03,866
King Rick is willing to release you on
parole if you're able to win 100 matches.

464
00:26:04,040 --> 00:26:07,628
Even if it takes years, that's
how you may earn your freedom.

465
00:26:11,980 --> 00:26:12,810
Yeah!

466
00:26:12,893 --> 00:26:15,040
We won the consecutive victories!

467
00:26:15,600 --> 00:26:19,188
Even our strongest gladiators
fell before the might of Kiros!

468
00:26:19,420 --> 00:26:23,217
He's not in the league, but he's
won his freedom in no time at all!

469
00:26:23,300 --> 00:26:25,594
That killer doesn't deserve to be free!

470
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:28,840
You're going to stay here.

471
00:26:29,120 --> 00:26:31,002
