472
00:26:32,600 --> 00:26:33,880
Hmm. That's strange.

473
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:36,777
You care about other people's
opinion all of a sudden?

474
00:26:36,860 --> 00:26:37,690
Shut up!

475
00:26:43,660 --> 00:26:49,420
I should have known, people only like
beasts, as long as they stay in a cage.

476
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:54,600
200 victories!

477
00:26:54,900 --> 00:26:56,740
Everybody take that guy out!

478
00:26:56,860 --> 00:26:57,800
They can pay!

479
00:27:01,440 --> 00:27:02,880
300 victories!

480
00:27:03,280 --> 00:27:08,100
The heroes line up one after another,
but heroes cut them down to size!

481
00:27:13,540 --> 00:27:14,370
Unbelievable!

482
00:27:14,453 --> 00:27:18,420
We are witnessing an
unprecedented 1 ,000 victories!

483
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:19,990
Go, Kiros!

484
00:27:20,580 --> 00:27:22,360
Nice work! You're awesome!

485
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:33,500
Hear it again, Kiros. Listen. Go away!

486
00:27:34,280 --> 00:27:35,860
